{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"DIM C(2,2,2)\nC(0,1,1) = 8\nPRINT C(0,1,1)\n\nDIM B(3,3) = [[1,2,3],[4,5,6],[7,8,9]]\nPRINT B(2,2)\n\n\nM=1\nFOR I = 0 TO 2\n  FOR J = 0 TO 2\n    ;B(I,J) = M\n    INC M\n  NEXT J\nNEXT I\n\nFOR K = 0 TO 2\n  FOR L = 0 TO 2\n    PRINT \"K = \" & K & \" L = \" & L & \" ARR = \" & B(K,L)\n  NEXT J\nNEXT I\n\n\n\nDIM A(10)=[0,2,6,4,8,3,7,8,2,6]\n\nFOR I=0 TO DIM(A)-1\n  PRINT A(I)\nNEXT I\n\nDIM B$(2)=[\"Hello\",\"bye\"]\n\nPRINT B$(0)\nPRINT B$(1)\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPRINT A","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}